    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 9,
    "title": "Compare qualities and performance",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-comparison-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Compare qualities and performance",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put a measured difference after the quality. 有/没有…这么/那么… compares a reached or unreached degree. For action performance, both 他跑得比我快 and 他比我跑得快 are possible: keep the people and the performance on the same comparison scale.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他比我大三岁。",
                "pinyin": "tā bǐ wǒ dà sān suì 。",
                "meaning": "He is three years older than me.",
                "audio": "fe441956d46ef7844244aa402452f5e825ff8a12ee8af8b55b2015bd6d66b93f"
              },
              {
                "text": "他有我这么高。",
                "pinyin": "tā yǒu wǒ zhème gāo 。",
                "meaning": "He reaches my height.",
                "audio": "46c400f9d1029d99e83d5ea7aaf8cf7e1205257f13f5fe4dcbb0c600adcd7345"
              },
              {
                "text": "他没有我那么高。",
                "pinyin": "tā méiyǒu wǒ nàme gāo 。",
                "meaning": "He is not as tall as me.",
                "audio": "4af8214efcf2b8466f5f25babcb99339440c9b90cbc04f8f83b74c298bf8d2b6"
              },
              {
                "text": "他跑得比我快。",
                "pinyin": "tā pǎo de bǐ wǒ kuài 。",
                "meaning": "He runs faster than I do.",
                "audio": "d6d7bf21288cedcac23a746c3620c6aba596040bd57a13a29ce27b4b6a745a1e"
              },
              {
                "text": "他比我跑得快。",
                "pinyin": "tā bǐ wǒ pǎo de kuài 。",
                "meaning": "He runs faster than I do.",
                "audio": "612a9719609d326fb446b4bf9834ba520ffe6d25772dc7fc132a18edeaffae19"
              }
            ]
          },
